  "generated_text": "Given that \\(\\gcd(a,b) = 168\\) and \\(\\gcd(a,c) = 693\\), we need to find the smallest possible value of \\(\\gcd(b,c)\\).\n\nFirst, we note the prime factorizations of the168\n 663 =\n\n\n16 = =      2                                                                                                                                                                                 }",
  "grade": {
